1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:02,270
(Leonard:)But the mission wouldn't be
for at least a year.

2
00:00:02,431 --> 00:00:04,341
(Leonard:)Isn't that enough time to get
your blood pressure under--

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,910
(Howard:)My blood pressure's too high, okay?
Drop it.

4
00:00:08,938 --> 00:00:11,548
(Penny:)You know, my aunt changed her diet,
and in a few months, she--

5
00:00:11,707 --> 00:00:14,277
(Howard:)Went to space? I don't think so.
Now, pass the soy sauce.

6
00:00:14,443 --> 00:00:15,853
(Howard:)Not the green one, the red one.

7
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,220
(Penny:)Sheldon, Amy,
will you please come join us?

8
00:00:20,349 --> 00:00:21,619
(Bernadette:)It's fun up here.

9
00:00:21,784 --> 00:00:24,194
(Leonard:)So why are you trying to ruin it?

10
00:00:25,354 --> 00:00:27,394
(Sheldon:)No, thanks. We're fine.

11
00:00:27,557 --> 00:00:29,537
(Sheldon:)I mean, if you people
want to eat at the table,

12
00:00:29,692 --> 00:00:31,532
(Sheldon:)then that's what you should do.

13
00:00:31,694 --> 00:00:33,234
(Sheldon:)I like eating down here

14
00:00:33,396 --> 00:00:35,966
(Sheldon:)because this is how
we've always done things.

15
00:00:36,132 --> 00:00:38,372
(Sheldon:)But if those days are gone,
they're gone.

16
00:00:38,534 --> 00:00:41,074
(Sheldon:)It just makes me sad.

17
00:00:42,805 --> 00:00:43,975
(Bernadette:)Now I feel bad.

18
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:46,590
(Leonard:)Don't anthropomorphize him,
he's got big eyes,

19
00:00:46,742 --> 00:00:48,952
(Leonard:)but his feelings are not like ours.

20
00:00:51,781 --> 00:00:54,281
(Bernadette:)No, It just seems silly
for us to sit in two groups.

21
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:56,230
Lt's not silly
if you think of that group

22
00:00:56,385 --> 00:00:58,885
(Leonard:)as being led by a big, evil baby.

23
00:01:04,227 --> 00:01:05,797
(Bernadette:)Look at Amy down there.

24
00:01:06,629 --> 00:01:07,969
(Bernadette:)Should we go?

25
00:01:08,598 --> 00:01:09,908
(Penny:)Let's go.

26
00:01:10,066 --> 00:01:11,606
(Leonard:)Penny, this was your idea.

27
00:01:11,767 --> 00:01:13,507
(Leonard:)You said that I should
stand up to him.

28
00:01:13,669 --> 00:01:14,979
(Penny:)Forget it, Leonard.

29
00:01:15,137 --> 00:01:16,617
(Penny:)It's over.

30
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:18,910
(Penny:)Fine.

31
00:01:25,414 --> 00:01:26,684
(Amy:)Rajesh?

32
00:01:26,849 --> 00:01:28,519
(Raj:)Screw that! I sat
on the floor for seven years.

33
00:01:28,684 --> 00:01:30,354
I'm staying right here!

34
00:01:31,654 --> 00:01:33,994
(Bernadette:)Come on, Raj,
it's not the same without you.

35
00:01:35,291 --> 00:01:36,701
(Penny:)Fine.

36
00:01:38,361 --> 00:01:40,601
(Raj:)But no more making fun
of how I say tings.

37
00:01:41,197 --> 00:01:43,337
You mean "tings"
like "moo-stache"?

38
00:01:49,939 --> 00:01:51,679
(Sheldon:)Well, isn't this nice.

39
00:01:54,277 --> 00:01:56,037
(Sheldon:)Sometimes the baby wins.

